---
layout: 'layouts/full-width.html'
title: Front-End Development Portfolio | Discoliam
pageTitle: Portfolio
description: Selected front-end development projects by Liam Richardson, including Shopify, WordPress, Vue and Eleventy builds, design systems and accessibility work.
tags: header
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Portfolio
  order: 2
---
<div class='Container'>
  <div class='Page__Header'>
    <div>
      <h1>Portfolio</h1>
      <p class='Lead'>
        Here's a selection of my work from the past few years. There's a mix of freelance projects and work from
        full-time roles. I've tried to link to anything that is still online, but contrary to most <s>Twitter</s>
        X controversies, the internet sometimes forgets.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class='Portfolio__Nav PortfolioNav'>
    {% assign navPages = collections.all | eleventyNavigation: 'Portfolio' %}
    {%- for entry in navPages %}
      {% include 'portfolio-card.liquid', entry: entry %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="LogoList__Wrapper">
    <h3>A Potted history of Projects</h3>
    <ul class='Logo__List'>
      {% for project in portfolio.projects %}
        <li class='Logo__Item'>
          {% assign svg_name = project | slugify %}
          {% svg svg_name %}
          <span class='sr-only'>{{ project }}</span>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="LogoList__Wrapper">
    <h3>A Selection of Clients</h3>
    <ul class='Logo__List'>
      {% for client in portfolio.clients %}
        <li class='Logo__Item'>
          {% assign svg_name = client | slugify %}
          {% svg svg_name %}
          <span class='sr-only'>{{ client }}</span>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>


</div>
